          "preserve_nested_disclosures": true
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "invariants": [
    "Do not change either approved mother template, mother-template-manifest.json, TAC_WORK_RULES.md or index.html.",
    "Do not remove or recreate red-circle plus controls, details/summary disclosure nodes, radio tabs, or event-card wrappers.",
    "News counts are exactly 5 focus stories and 10 market headlines; a mismatch is a hard failure, not permission to fabricate or silently truncate.",
    "Economic calendar: preserve the provider-native 1–3 star scale and include only 3-star events in the curated feed. Earnings may display a 3-star rating only when a source explicitly provides it; otherwise importance_stars must be null and the major-event assessment basis/source must be recorded. Never infer or convert a rating.",
    "Every inserted news item and calendar event must retain source URL and source observation timestamp in its source detail area.",
    "Missing or unverified source data must remain pending; no narrative inference from missing fields.",
    "Market sentiment and summary must cite verified snapshot field IDs and verified content IDs.",
    "Content schema v2 requires explicit coverage states; empty arrays are not evidence of a completed source check.",
    "Monday previous-week economic and earnings sections are sourced from previous_economic_calendar and previous_earnings_calendar; weekday versions mark these groups not_applicable.",
    "Summary headline and body are distinct fields; market observation uses separate market_view, key_levels and core_observations tab fields.",
    "All 3-star filtering and source-native earnings-rating rules are enforced by the content validator before rendering."
  ],
  "content_schema_version": 2
}
